---
title: Rhubarb Bread Pudding
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 1 hour
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@egg{1%beaten}
@milk{1%cup}
@sugar{0.75%cup}
@bread cubes{2%cups}
@cut rhubarb{2%cups}
@lemon juice{1.5%Tbsp}
@butter
@whipped cream

Mix all ingredients together and put in a buttered casserole. Put dabs of butter on top. Bake at 375 degrees for 1 hour. Serve warm with whipped cream.
